  "id": "cloudsync-records-e2e",
  "description": "Records in end-to-end mode (§13.3, §13.10). The record id, a merge field and a union element are blinded names (x: and 43 characters) and the value is a sealed ct. A value, an unblinded id, field or element is encryption_mismatch; a malformed envelope is value_invalid. The pull answers ct for a record, fields [{field, ct, editedHlc}] for a merge record and elements [{element, ct}] for a union record, with encryption and encryptionSince. A max record is a compare-and-swap register. Once the store holds sealed rows, a plaintext write made in server mode is refused encryption_mismatch.",
